---
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL.replace(/\/$/, '');
const api = import.meta.env.PUBLIC_EV_API || '';
const title = 'Surprise EV trip planner (draft)';
const description = 'Draft: a random place in India, a real road route, and a day-by-day plan for a Mahindra BE 6 with charging stops, savings and gaps shown.';
---
<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"/><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"/><title>{title}</title><meta name="description" content={description}/><meta name="robots" content="noindex"/><meta name="theme-color" content="#f8f8f4"/>
<link rel="stylesheet" href={`${base}/ev-planner/app.css`}/></head>
<body style="margin:0"><div class="evp">
  <header class="evp-nav"><a href="https://www.venumadhavpandit.com/">← Back to the builds</a><span>Draft, not launched</span></header>
  <main class="evp-main">
    <div class="evp-intro"><span class="eyebrow">SURPRISE TRIP · BE 6 SPORTEQ</span><h1>Where should the EV <span>take you?</span></h1><p>A random place in India, a real road route and a day-by-day charging plan. Live routing needs a backend that is not deployed yet, so this draft shows one labelled worked example.</p></div>
    <div id="ev-root"></div>
    <p class="evp-attr">Map data © <a href="https://www.openstreetmap.org/copyright">OpenStreetMap contributors</a> (ODbL). Food, lodging and visit names come from the OpenStreetMap extract of 22 Oct 2026 (<a href="https://download.geofabrik.de/asia/india.html">Geofabrik</a>), published as a derived dataset under the <a href="https://opendatacommons.org/licenses/odbl/1-0/">ODbL</a>: <a href={`${base}/ev-planner/osm_near.json`}>osm_near.json</a>. Chargers: <a href="https://openchargemap.org">Open Charge Map</a> (CC BY 4.0) and Charge_iN by Mahindra's station map. Routes: OpenRouteService by HeiGIT. India outline: Survey of India, simplified (draft, licence review pending).</p>
    <footer class="evp-foot"><span>Built by Venumadhav Pandit</span><a href="https://www.venumadhavpandit.com/">Back to the builds ↗</a></footer>
  </main></div>
<script is:inline define:vars={{ api }}>window.EV_API = api;</script>
<script is:inline src={`${base}/ev-planner/app.js`} defer></script></body></html>
